it','gameplay-architect','cinematics-sequencer','animation-architect','network-transport','input-devices-haptics','render-2d-vector','audio-architect','functional-automation-soak','terrain','character-vehicle-physics','world-architect'):\n    print(k['id'],'::',k['purpose']); print('   NR:',k['non_responsibilities'])\n\"","description":"Show purposes of skills relevant to candidate gaps"}},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfXzjRoHyGD5d5YbRXLei","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"3633eeaf-fdaa-46da-9ad2-b793bd9df6dc","timestamp":"2026-09-29T15:50:52.237Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1"}
{"parentUuid":"3633eeaf-fdaa-46da-9ad2-b793bd9df6dc","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"9bdfc07b-8ff1-4e95-9c88-de7440fd6192","agentId":"aa9944ad1d1eb99b1","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AnBsQyL9Lf6Mq2dPZ3iCbs","type":"tool_result","content":"functional-automation-soak :: Game-level automation: scripted and bot playthroughs, smoke/boot tests, soak and stability runs (memory growth, leaks), hardware/OS compatibility matrix, network harnesses and server load tests.\n   NR: [['Unit test frameworks', 'test-architect'], ['Device-farm infrastructure', 'ci-cd-automation']]\nplatform-online-services :: Abstraction over first-party platform services and third-party online backends: identity and sign-in, achievements and presence, entitlements and store, cloud saves, matchmaking/lobby/session boundaries, remote config, moderation boundaries, media capture, crossplay identity.\n   NR: [['Game-server hosting', 'dedicated-server'], ['Save-game content', 'persistence-save'], ['Backend implementation (outside engine scope)', 'engine-architect']]\ninput-devices-haptics :: Device layer: keyboard/mouse raw input, gamepads, touch and gestures, motion sensors, pen, hotplug and user pairing, haptics (rumble, HD haptics, adaptive triggers).\n   NR: [['Action mapping', 'input-system'], ['XR controllers', 'xr-runtime']]\nxr-runtime :: XR integration: OpenXR, stereo/multiview rendering hooks, foveation, reprojection and latency, XR input and hand tracking, comfort and safety requirements.\n   NR: [['Render pipeline', 'render-architect'], ['Generic input actions', 'input-system']]\nworld-architect :: World representation strategy (data-oriented, no universal scene graph), partitioning and streaming cells, streaming sources, HLOD strategy, simulation LOD and significance, large-world coordinate policy, level transitions, server-side world streaming.\n   NR: [['World document format', 'world-data-model'], ['Transform math', 'spatial-transforms'], ['HLOD mesh generation', 'virtualized-geometry-lod']]\nterrain :: Terrain end-to-end: representation, rendering, material layering, sculpt/paint tool logic, runtime deformation, collision data hand-off.\n   NR: [['Virtual texturing core', 'texture-streaming-vt'], ['Viewport hosting', 'world-editor-viewport'], ['Collision algorithms', 'collision-detection']]\nrender-2d-vector :: 2D draw backend shared by 2D games, UI and debug overlays: sprites, tilemaps, 2D lighting, vector paths, UI batching/clipping/SDF, HDR compositing, pixel-perfect modes.\n   NR: [['Widget model', 'ui-architect'], ['Glyph shaping', 'text-fonts']]\ncharacter-vehicle-physics :: Character controllers (kinematic and dynamic), vehicles (wheels, tires, suspension, drivetrain), buoyancy, moving platforms and physical interaction.\n   NR: [['Movement gameplay logic', 'gameplay-systems-toolkit'], ['Movement prediction', 'prediction-rollback']]\nanimation-architect :: Animation architecture: data model, parallel evaluation pipeline, animation/physics/gameplay sync and root-motion policy, animation LOD, budgets.\n   NR: [['Sampling and blending', 'animation-runtime'], ['Skinning', 'deformation-skinning']]\ncinematics-sequencer :: Timeline/sequencer, camera cuts and cinematic cameras, high-quality movie rendering, cutscene streaming and preloading.\n   NR: [['Gameplay camera', 'gameplay-systems-toolkit'], ['Path tracer', 'path-tracing']]\naudio-architect :: Audio engine architecture and threading, device backends, voice management and virtualization, middleware decision, audio budgets.\n   NR: [['DSP algorithms', 'audio-dsp-mixing'], ['Spatialization', 'spatial-audio-acoustics']]\nnetwork-transport :: UDP sockets and platform network APIs, reliability and ordering, fragmentation, congestion control, encryption and authentication, NAT traversal and relays, connection lifecycle, link simulation, QUIC/WebTransport evaluation.\n   NR: [['What is replicated', 'replication'], ['Relay service operation', 'platform-online-services']]\ngameplay-architect :: Gameplay framework: rules, players and possession, extension points and game-module structure, game flow and transitions, local players.\n   NR: [['Abilities/tags/camera toolkit', 'gameplay-systems-toolkit'], ['Scripting VM', 'scripting-runtime'], ['Game-specific code (the game team)', 'engine-architect']]\ngameplay-systems-toolkit :: Reusable gameplay systems: abilities, effects and attributes, gameplay tags, camera system, spawning and pooling, gameplay message routing, photo mode.\n   NR: [['Generic events', 'entity-object-model'], ['Cinematic cameras', 'cinematics-sequencer']]","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"9bdbb86f-25c8-4d67-9c30-871eaa1bf7cb","timestamp":"2026-09-29T15:50:52.339Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3633eeaf-fdaa-46da-9ad2-b793bd9df6dc","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1"}
